  "name": "Primalist Geode Barrage: physical damage with Nature spell power",
  "contract": "Three physical stones each add 36% Nature spell power and 9% attack power before armor mitigation. 502771 rolls its stone damage once per cast (EffectBasePoints 64, DieSides 5: 65-69 at the caster's level 22 = SpellLevel), so a cast's three stones match. With 72 Nature spell power and 62 attack power a stone is (65..69 + 25.92 + 5.58) x 0.974 (the PvE tuning that spell_damage_done reads as 974 of 1000) x 0.783..0.793 (armor_reduced_damage 783-793 of 1000 for the bear's recorded armor of 596-630), 73.6..77.6, recorded as 73-77; without the spell power it is 54-57, so a 70-80 bound on the mean noncritical stone still needs the 36% coefficient. A total bound of 185-225 over the three stones rejected the high rolls (228, 231) and a single critical stone (262, 291).",
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
